"Author: Linus Torvalds <torvalds@g5.osdl.org>\n"
"Date:   Mon Aug 15 17:23:51 2005 -0700\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: ../Documentation-sedout/SubmittingPatches.adoc:872
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Fix pine whitespace-corruption bug\n"
msgstr "    Fix pine whitespace-corruption bug\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: ../Documentation-sedout/SubmittingPatches.adoc:875
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    There's no excuse for unconditionally removing whitespace from\n"
"    the pico buffers on close.\n"
msgstr ""
"    There's no excuse for unconditionally removing whitespace from\n"
"    the pico buffers on close.\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: ../Documentation-sedout/SubmittingPatches.adoc:888
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"diff --git a/pico/pico.c b/pico/pico.c\n"
"--- a/pico/pico.c\n"
"+++ b/pico/pico.c\n"
"@@ -219,7 +219,9 @@ PICO *pm;\n"
"\t    switch(pico_all_done){\t/* prepare for/handle final events */\n"
"\t      case COMP_EXIT :\t\t/* already confirmed */\n"
"\t\tpackheader();\n"
"+#if 0\n"
"\t\tstripwhitespace();\n"
"+#endif\n"
"\t\tc |= COMP_EXIT;\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
msgstr ""
"diff --git a/pico/pico.c b/pico/pico.c\n"
"--- a/pico/pico.c\n"
"+++ b/pico/pico.c\n"
"@@ -219,7 +219,9 @@ PICO *pm;\n"
"\t    switch(pico_all_done){\t/* prepare for/handle final events */\n"
"\t      case COMP_EXIT :\t\t/* already confirmed */\n"
"\t\tpackheader();\n"
"+#if 0\n"
"\t\tstripwhitespace();\n"
"+#endif\n"
"\t\tc |= COMP_EXIT;\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/SubmittingPatches.adoc:891
msgid "(Daniel Barkalow)"
msgstr "(Daniel Barkalow)"

#. type: delimited block .
#: ../Documentation-sedout/SubmittingPatches.adoc:895
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> A patch to SubmittingPatches, MUA specific help section for\n"
"> users of Pine 4.63 would be very much appreciated.\n"
msgstr ""
"> SubmittingPatches に、Pine 4.63 ユーザ向けの MUA 固有の\n"
"> ヘルプセクションを追加するパッチは、とてもありがたいと思います。\n"

#. type: delimited block .
#: ../Documentation-sedout/SubmittingPatches.adoc:902
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ah, it looks like a recent version changed the default behavior to do the\n"
"right thing, and inverted the sense of the configuration option. (Either\n"
"that or Gentoo did it.) So you need to set the\n"
"\"no-strip-whitespace-before-send\" option, unless the option you have is\n"
"\"strip-whitespace-before-send\", in which case you should avoid checking\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"えーっと、 最近のバージョンでデフォルトの振る舞いがが正しいものに変更され、\n"
"設定オプションの意味が逆になったようです(もしくは Gentoo がそうしたのかもしれません)。\n"
"`no-strip-whitespace-before-send` オプションが存在するなら、それを設定(set)する必要があります。\n"
"そして\n"
"`strip-whitespace-before-send` オプションは設定を外す(unset)する必要があります。\n"

